        <Asset>
            <Template>Text</Template>
            <Values>
                <Standard>
                    <GUID>1404001224</GUID>
                    <Name>LoadingTip Orient Noria</Name>
                </Standard>
                <Text>
                    <LocaText>
                        <English>
                            <Text>Norias lift water from deep underground to irrigate your fields. Build them at a distance from each other, or they will drain the aquifers dry.</Text>
                        </English>
                    </LocaText>
                </Text>
            </Values>
        </Asset>
        <Asset>
            <Template>Text</Template>
            <Values>
                <Standard>
                    <GUID>1404001225</GUID>
                    <Name>LoadingTip Orient Consulate</Name>
                </Standard>
                <Text>
                    <LocaText>
                        <English>
                            <Text>Consulates are the main channel of communication with the sultan. They create the necessary paperwork for approval to build advanced buildings.</Text>
                        </English>
                    </LocaText>
                </Text>
            </Values>
        </Asset>
        <Asset>
            <Template>Text</Template>
            <Values>
                <Standard>
                    <GUID>1404001226</GUID>
                    <Name>LoadingTip Orient Grand Mosque</Name>
                </Standard>
                <Text>
                    <LocaText>
                        <English>
                            <Text>The Grand Mosque is a symbol of your commitment to the sultanate. Each pilgrimage gains you favor and influence with the court of the sultan.</Text>
                        </English>
                    </LocaText>
                </Text>
            </Values>
        </Asset>
        <Asset>
            <Template>Text</Template>
            <Values>
                <Standard>
                    <GUID>1404001227</GUID>
                    <Name>LoadingTip Orient Marketstalls</Name>
                </Standard>
                <Text>
                    <LocaText>
                        <English>
                            <Text>Envoys are curious about the new wares and inventions of the industrial age. Market stalls are a great way of showing them off and letting envoys try them out.</Text>
                        </English>
                    </LocaText>
                </Text>
            </Values>
        </Asset>
<Asset>
            <Template>Text</Template>
            <Values>
                <Standard>
                    <GUID>1404001228</GUID>
                    <Name>LoadingTip Orient Hacienda Types</Name>
                </Standard>
                <Text>
                    <LocaText>
                        <English>
                            <Text>Bedouin Camps, Research Outposts and the Sultan's Palace each attract residents with their own needs and offer different decrees to improve your city and production.</Text>
                        </English>
                    </LocaText>
                </Text>
            </Values>
        </Asset>
        <Asset>
            <Template>Text</Template>
            <Values>
                <Standard>
                    <GUID>1404001229</GUID>
                    <Name>LoadingTip Orient Flotation Concentrate</Name>
                </Standard>
                <Text>
                    <LocaText>
                        <English>
                            <Text>Flotation Concentrate lets you extract silver from ore in the Orient and can also boost your smelters in other regions.</Text>
                        </English>
                    </LocaText>
                </Text>
            </Values>
        </Asset>
        <Asset>
            <Template>Text</Template>
            <Values>
                <Standard>
                    <GUID>1404001239</GUID>
                    <Name>LoadingTip Orient Lighthouse</Name>
                </Standard>
                <Text>
                    <LocaText>
                        <English>
                            <Text>The Oriental Lighthouse has an item socket for beacons. Each beacon boosts all of your ships of a certain type across all regions.</Text>
                        </English>
                    </LocaText>
                </Text>
            </Values>
        </Asset>
